      "heading": "Recruitment",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "To recruit Goren before completing Nightfall, first select Norgu during Brains or Brawn and then complete Goren's Stuff: Part 1. If you select Goren as the Brawn, then you cannot recruit him until after completing Nightfall by taking Gain Goren while in the Throne of Secrets."
