  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; text-align:left; font-size:90%; background-color:white;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"infobox npc-infobox\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#EBB;\">Goren\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\" class=\"infobox-image\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Goren_Vabbian_armor.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Goren Vabbian armor.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/4d/Goren_Vabbian_armor.jpg/150px-Goren_Vabbian_armor.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/4d/Goren_Vabbian_armor.jpg/225px-Goren_Vabbian_armor.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/4d/Goren_Vabbian_armor.jpg/300px-Goren_Vabbian_armor.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"450\" data-file-height=\"900\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Affiliation\" title=\"Affiliation\">Affiliation</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbians</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Creature_type\" title=\"Creature type\">Type</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Profession\" title=\"Profession\">Profession</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Warrior\" title=\"Warrior\">Warrior</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/NPC_service\" title=\"NPC service\">Service</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hero\" title=\"Hero\">Hero</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Level\" title=\"Level\">Level(s)</a>\n</th>\n<td>18..20\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#EBB;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p><i>Dedicated Bodyguard</i><br />\n\"The prince likes to give orders. I like to take orders. It's a good life.\"<br />\n<b>Origin:</b> Vabbi<br />\n<b>Age:</b> 28<br />\n<b>Profession:</b> Warrior<br />\n<a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goren</a> is big. Goren is strong. Goren is really, really good at sprinting into battle. Unfortunately, Goren isn't exactly the sharpest blade in the armory. He understands everyday conversation, and he can carry out simple commands – particularly sentences with the words \"hit\" and \"smash\" in them – but the finer philosophical passages of the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Flameseeker_Prophecies\" title=\"Flameseeker Prophecies\">Flameseeker Prophecies</a></i> will remain eternally outside his comprehension. Eager for work, Goren has found employment working as the bodyguard of <a href=\"/wiki/Prince_Bokka_the_Magnificent\" title=\"Prince Bokka the Magnificent\">Prince Bokka the Magnificent</a>. Money and influence don't mean much to him, though. Loyalty does.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Gameplay_manual\" title=\"Gameplay manual\">The Guild Wars Nightfall Manuscripts</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Missions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Missions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Quests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Recruitment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Recruitment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Skills\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Skills</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Armor\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Armor</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Quotes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quotes</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Storyline_quotes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Storyline quotes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Battle_quotes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Battle quotes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Locations\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bokka_Amphitheatre\" title=\"Bokka Amphitheatre\">Bokka Amphitheatre</a> (during the quest <a href=\"/wiki/All%27s_Well_That_Ends_Well\" title=\"All&#39;s Well That Ends Well\">All's Well That Ends Well</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Holdings_of_Chokhin\" title=\"Holdings of Chokhin\">Holdings of Chokhin</a> (during the early parts of <a href=\"/wiki/Greed_and_Regret\" title=\"Greed and Regret\">Greed and Regret</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Resplendent_Makuun\" title=\"Resplendent Makuun\">Resplendent Makuun</a> (before completion of <a href=\"/wiki/Brains_or_Brawn\" title=\"Brains or Brawn\">Brains or Brawn</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">The Mirror of Lyss</a> (during the later parts of <a href=\"/wiki/Greed_and_Regret\" title=\"Greed and Regret\">Greed and Regret</a>)</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Realm of Torment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Throne_of_Secrets\" title=\"Throne of Secrets\">Throne of Secrets</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Missions\">Missions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Missions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Tihark_Orchard\" title=\"Tihark Orchard\">Tihark Orchard</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dasha_Vestibule\" title=\"Dasha Vestibule\">Dasha Vestibule</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests\">Quests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Quests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i><sup>R</sup> indicates that Goren must be in the party</i></dd></dl>\n<p><b>Quests given:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Goren%27s_Stuff:_Part_1\" title=\"Goren&#39;s Stuff: Part 1\">Goren's Stuff: Part 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gain_Goren\" title=\"Gain Goren\">Gain Goren</a></li></ul>\n<p><b>Quests involved in:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Greed_and_Regret\" title=\"Greed and Regret\">Greed and Regret</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Brains_or_Brawn\" title=\"Brains or Brawn\">Brains or Brawn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Scorched_Earth_(Nightfall_quest)\" title=\"Scorched Earth (Nightfall quest)\">Scorched Earth</a> <sup>R</sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Valley_of_the_Rifts\" title=\"Valley of the Rifts\">Valley of the Rifts</a> <sup>R</sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/In_Defense_of_Theatre\" title=\"In Defense of Theatre\">In Defense of Theatre</a> <sup>R</sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Goren%27s_Stuff:_Part_2\" title=\"Goren&#39;s Stuff: Part 2\">Goren's Stuff: Part 2</a> <sup>R</sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recruitment\">Recruitment</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Recruitment\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:GorenUnlocked.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"GorenUnlocked.jpg\" src=\"/images/9/9a/GorenUnlocked.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"274\" height=\"168\" data-file-width=\"274\" data-file-height=\"168\" /></a></div>\n<ul><li>To recruit Goren before completing Nightfall, first select <a href=\"/wiki/Norgu\" title=\"Norgu\">Norgu</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Brains_or_Brawn\" title=\"Brains or Brawn\">Brains or Brawn</a> and then complete <a href=\"/wiki/Goren%27s_Stuff:_Part_1\" title=\"Goren&#39;s Stuff: Part 1\">Goren's Stuff: Part 1</a>.</li>\n<li>If you select Goren as the <i>Brawn</i>, then you cannot recruit him until after completing Nightfall by taking <a href=\"/wiki/Gain_Goren\" title=\"Gain Goren\">Gain Goren</a> while in the <a href=\"/wiki/Throne_of_Secrets\" title=\"Throne of Secrets\">Throne of Secrets</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Skills\">Skills</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Skills\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%22Watch_Yourself!%22\" title=\"&quot;Watch Yourself!&quot;\"><img alt=\"&quot;Watch Yourself!&quot;\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/9f/%22Watch_Yourself%21%22.jpg/25px-%22Watch_Yourself%21%22.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9f/%22Watch_Yourself%21%22.jpg/38px-%22Watch_Yourself%21%22.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9f/%22Watch_Yourself%21%22.jpg/50px-%22Watch_Yourself%21%22.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/%22Watch_Yourself!%22\" title=\"&quot;Watch Yourself!&quot;\">\"Watch Yourself!\"</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Irresistible_Blow\" title=\"Irresistible Blow\"><img alt=\"Irresistible Blow\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/2b/Irresistible_Blow.jpg/25px-Irresistible_Blow.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/2b/Irresistible_Blow.jpg/38px-Irresistible_Blow.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/2b/Irresistible_Blow.jpg/50px-Irresistible_Blow.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Irresistible_Blow\" title=\"Irresistible Blow\">Irresistible Blow</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lion%27s_Comfort\" title=\"Lion&#39;s Comfort\"><img alt=\"Lion&#39;s Comfort\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/fc/Lion%27s_Comfort.jpg/25px-Lion%27s_Comfort.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/fc/Lion%27s_Comfort.jpg/38px-Lion%27s_Comfort.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/fc/Lion%27s_Comfort.jpg/50px-Lion%27s_Comfort.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Lion%27s_Comfort\" title=\"Lion&#39;s Comfort\">Lion's Comfort</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mighty_Blow\" title=\"Mighty Blow\"><img alt=\"Mighty Blow\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/da/Mighty_Blow.jpg/25px-Mighty_Blow.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/da/Mighty_Blow.jpg/38px-Mighty_Blow.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/da/Mighty_Blow.jpg/50px-Mighty_Blow.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mighty_Blow\" title=\"Mighty Blow\">Mighty Blow</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soldier%27s_Defense\" title=\"Soldier&#39;s Defense\"><img alt=\"Soldier&#39;s Defense\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/ee/Soldier%27s_Defense.jpg/25px-Soldier%27s_Defense.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ee/Soldier%27s_Defense.jpg/38px-Soldier%27s_Defense.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ee/Soldier%27s_Defense.jpg/50px-Soldier%27s_Defense.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Soldier%27s_Defense\" title=\"Soldier&#39;s Defense\">Soldier's Defense</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resurrection_Signet\" title=\"Resurrection Signet\"><img alt=\"Resurrection Signet\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/e0/Resurrection_Signet.jpg/25px-Resurrection_Signet.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e0/Resurrection_Signet.jpg/38px-Resurrection_Signet.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e0/Resurrection_Signet.jpg/50px-Resurrection_Signet.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Resurrection_Signet\" title=\"Resurrection Signet\">Resurrection Signet</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Armor\">Armor</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Armor\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Goren/Armor_gallery\" title=\"Goren/Armor gallery\">His armor gallery</a>.</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Goren starts with basic Vabbian Armor.\n<ul><li>This can be upgraded to <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_armor\" title=\"Mysterious armor\">Mysterious armor</a> by providing <a href=\"/wiki/Mureh\" title=\"Mureh\">Mureh</a> with <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Armor_Pieces\" title=\"Mysterious Armor Pieces\">Mysterious Armor Pieces</a> (from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow_Nexus\" title=\"The Shadow Nexus\">The Shadow Nexus</a>).</li>\n<li>Alternatively, it can be upgraded to <a href=\"/wiki/Primeval_armor\" title=\"Primeval armor\">Primeval armor</a> by providing the <a href=\"/wiki/Armorsmith_of_Whispers\" title=\"Armorsmith of Whispers\">Armorsmith of Whispers</a> with <a href=\"/wiki/Primeval_Armor_Remnants\" title=\"Primeval Armor Remnants\">Primeval Armor Remnants</a> (from the <a href=\"/wiki/Domain_of_Anguish\" title=\"Domain of Anguish\">Domain of Anguish</a>).</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Vabbi:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"The boss says to stand here and guard. I better not move or he'll get angry.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<p>During <a href=\"/wiki/Brains_or_Brawn\" title=\"Brains or Brawn\">Brains or Brawn</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Goren%27s_Stuff:_Part_1\" title=\"Goren&#39;s Stuff: Part 1\">Goren's Stuff: Part 1</a>:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Wait, what? Oh! Hi! Did you need protection? Want me to hit something? Need a backrub? Whatever you want, boss. Prince Bokka said I was the best bodyguard to ever work for him. But I think he just said that because he wasn't dead. I mean, I guess that's good, right?</i></dd></dl>\n<p>Dasha Vestibule mission:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"I hope Prince Bokka will be happy to see me.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<p>Throne of Secrets:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Ahai, hero! I want to be just like you!\"</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Quotes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Storyline_quotes\">Storyline quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Storyline quotes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Quotes in the context of the Nightfall storyline:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Pledge_of_the_Merchant_Princes\" title=\"Pledge of the Merchant Princes\">Pledge of the Merchant Princes</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"I think, after the end of the world, I'm going to ask <a href=\"/wiki/Margrid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Margrid\">Margrid</a> to go out with me. Do you think she will say yes?\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Court_of_Sebelkeh\" title=\"Grand Court of Sebelkeh\">Grand Court of Sebelkeh</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"They attacked the temple of <a href=\"/wiki/Lyssa\" title=\"Lyssa\">Lyssa</a>? That's like eating a kitten... it's just plain wrong! No one should ever do that! Ever!\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Attack_at_the_Kodash\" title=\"Attack at the Kodash\">Attack at the Kodash</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Butoh_the_Bold\" title=\"Butoh the Bold\">Butoh the Bold</a> and I used to dice for chicken legs. I bet he was wishing he'd won more chicken legs and less demons.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Jennur%27s_Horde\" title=\"Jennur&#39;s Horde\">Jennur's Horde</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Nundu_Bay\" title=\"Nundu Bay\">Nundu Bay</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Ronjok\" title=\"Ronjok\">Ronjok</a> needs us! Oh my gosh. Oh my gosh. What do we do?\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Desolation\" title=\"Gate of Desolation\">Gate of Desolation</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Elona needs us! Oh my gosh. Oh my gosh. What do we do?\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/A_Deal%27s_a_Deal\" title=\"A Deal&#39;s a Deal\">A Deal's a Deal</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Evil, beware. We have <a href=\"/wiki/Junundu\" title=\"Junundu\">wurms</a>!\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Horde_of_Darkness\" title=\"Horde of Darkness\">Horde of Darkness</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Here we go, hunting <a href=\"/wiki/Elder_Siege_Wurm\" title=\"Elder Siege Wurm\">Elder wurms</a>. And then, we have to eat them. This is the weirdest quest we've ever gone on.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_of_Morah\" title=\"Ruins of Morah\">Ruins of Morah</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Palawa_Joko\" title=\"Palawa Joko\">Palawa Joko</a>. Why does that name sound familiar. Oh! Now I remember! Mom has a recipe for palawajinko soup! Wow...that's not the same thing at all.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Uncharted_Territory\" title=\"Uncharted Territory\">Uncharted Territory</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Like a great salmon, we must forge up the stream of evil and stop it before it spawns.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Pain\" title=\"Gate of Pain\">Gate of Pain</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Time to go to the <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Fear\" title=\"Gate of Fear\">Gate of Fear</a>. They need us there.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kormir%27s_Crusade\" title=\"Kormir&#39;s Crusade\">Kormir's Crusade</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"I swore I was going to beat <a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon\" title=\"Abaddon\">Abaddon</a> up. I'm going to make good on that promise.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/All_Alone_in_the_Darkness\" title=\"All Alone in the Darkness\">All Alone in the Darkness</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Evil's out there, making knitted scarves for the cold winter of Nightfall. And we've got to stop it before it snows Armageddon on us all.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Madness\" title=\"Gate of Madness\">Gate of Madness</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Are you ready? Our visit at the Gate of Madness may be the last chance we have to say goodbye to everyone, so make sure you remember. Like a holiday list. Check them off, one by one.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon%27s_Gate\" title=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate\">Abaddon's Gate</a>:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Now we have to do it. Do what? Ah, there's the mystery. We have to do what we do when we do that thing that does the thing to save the world. Save the world, that's the thing. And we're here to do it 'till it's done.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall_campaign\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall campaign\">Nightfall campaign</a> completed:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>\"I gotta warn ya... I think that other guy's kind of slow.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Battle_quotes\">Battle quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Battle quotes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a> bless my weapon!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"For justice! And truth! And… stuff!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"Here we go again!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"Hooo-ah!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"Hey! He actually hit me!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"Hey, that's cheating!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"Ow! Hey! That's not fair!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"Ow! Ow! Ow!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"These are fists of mass destruction you're facing, bub!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"Villains! You face Goren!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"What?\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"Whoa-oh! Surprise move! Bonus round!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"You think that hurt? Try this!\"</i></dd>\n<dd><i>\"Your wave of evil crashes on the shores of Goren!\"</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>A duplicate Goren will show up as a \"Vabbian Warrior\".</li>\n<li>Goren's default weapon is a customized blue <a href=\"/wiki/Barrel_Hammer\" title=\"Barrel Hammer\">Barrel Hammer</a> of Fortitude with 17-30 damage, an attribute requirement of 7 and +20 Health.</li>\n<li>After the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Goren%27s_Stuff:_Part_2\" title=\"Goren&#39;s Stuff: Part 2\">Goren's Stuff: Part 2</a>, Goren became the \"mommy\" of <a href=\"/wiki/Shiny\" title=\"Shiny\">Shiny</a>, a baby dragon.</li>\n<li>As with all heroes, this one has a <a href=\"/wiki/Everlasting_Goren_Tonic\" title=\"Everlasting Goren Tonic\">tonic form</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Goren&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The all-purpose battle quote <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/hooah\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:hooah\">\"Hooo-ah!\"</a> is used in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/united_states_army\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:united states army\">U.S. Army</a>.</li>\n<li>The line \"For justice! And truth! And… stuff!\" may be a reference to <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Hitchhiker%27s_Guide_to_the_Galaxy_(film)\"><i>The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy\"</i></a> movie, where <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zaphod_Beeblebrox\">Zaphod Beeblebrox</a> says \"For freedom! And democracy! And stuff!\".</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Voice_actors\" title=\"Category:Voice actors\">Voice acting</a> for this character is done by <a href=\"/wiki/Robin_Atkin_Downes\" title=\"Robin Atkin Downes\">Robin Atkin Downes</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; width:465px; font-size:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background:#CCD; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hero\" title=\"Hero\">Heroes</a> <small>(<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Heroes_nav\" title=\"Template:Heroes nav\">edit</a>)</small>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#CCD;\"><i><b>Guide to: <a href=\"/wiki/Guide_to_Hero_Basics_and_Optimization\" title=\"Guide to Hero Basics and Optimization\">Basics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hero_flag\" title=\"Hero flag\">Control</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hero_behavior\" title=\"Hero behavior\">Behavior</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/New_Players%27s_Guide_to_Heroes\" title=\"New Players&#39;s Guide to Heroes\">Beginner's Guide</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_hero-vetted_skills\" title=\"List of hero-vetted skills\">Vetted Skills</a><br />Equipment: <a href=\"/wiki/Hero_armorer\" title=\"Hero armorer\">Armorer</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Hero_skill_point\" title=\"Hero skill point\">Skill point</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Hero_skill_trainer\" title=\"Hero skill trainer\">Skill Trainer</a></b></i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f0f0f5;\">\n<th style=\"background:#CCD; width:110px\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Nightfall_heroes\" title=\"List of Nightfall heroes\">Nightfall</a>\n</th>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap; margin-right:5px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goren</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Koss\" title=\"Koss\">Koss</a></span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap; margin-right:5px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Jin\" title=\"Acolyte Jin\">Acolyte Jin</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Margrid_the_Sly\" title=\"Margrid the Sly\">Margrid the Sly</a></span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap; margin-right:5px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Dunkoro\" title=\"Dunkoro\">Dunkoro</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Tahlkora\" title=\"Tahlkora\">Tahlkora</a></span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap; margin-right:5px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a